cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Code for: Neuronal and glial transcriptional states vary with proximity to tangle-bearing neurons in the human entorhinal cortex"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-06
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/slboulger/Tangle_Neighbours"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a study combining 6,000-plex CosMx spatial transcriptomics
  of human entorhinal cortex with post-run PHF1 immunofluorescence (167,176 cells,
  9 donors) and imaging mass cytometry (127,157 cells, 44 donors) to characterise
  tangle-bearing neurons and how neuronal and glial states vary with distance to
  the nearest tangle-bearing neuron.
keywords:
  - Alzheimer's disease
  - neurofibrillary tangles
  - tau
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - CosMx
  - imaging mass cytometry
  - entorhinal cortex
